	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 11th level, your stronghold increases to a Grade 3.</p><p>Also at 11th level, you leverage your shield to further keep you out of harm’s way. If you would fail a Dexterity saving throw against a spell or other magical effects, you may use your reaction to sacrifice your shield in the same manner as negating a critical hit, turning the failure into a success instead. Once you have used this ability, you must repair your shield before you can use it again.</p>",
